  "description": "JEXWIW crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 41 21 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C94 H96 Dy6 N12 O34 2+,13(C1 H4 O1),2(N1 O3 1-),14(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1F (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2F (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3F (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.542-4.204 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.53-117.04°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L)6(CH3OH)4(H2O)6](NO3)2·13CH3OH·14H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
